<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39910" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικτάομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gain</i> or <i>win besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					901
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατρίοισι νόμοισι</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλον οὐδένα ἐπικτῶνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.79
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἀρχήν</span>
			<i>extend one's</i> empire, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.144
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὰ μὴ προσήκοντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.61
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριήρεις κέκτησθε πολλὰς καὶ</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάτριον ὑμῖν ἐστι ναυτικὸν ἐπικτᾶσθαι</span>
			<i>add to those</i> you have, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.1.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόνδ᾽ ἐ. σύμμαχον</span>
			<i>as</i> an ally, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				671
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυμμάρτυρας ὔμμ᾽ ἐ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				846
			</span></i> (lyr.); <i>acquire additional</i> property, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGiss.</u>
				108.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, etc.:—late in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				1.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				123.4
			</span></i>.</div>
